# Supabase CLI local state
.branches
.temp

# Local secrets
.env*
# …except the local values, which are committed on purpose: not a secret among
# them, only the addresses this stack answers on, and a developer who has to
# invent them before `supabase start` will run is a developer who guesses.
!.env
# The example is committed too. The filled-in copy is not — nothing in it is
# secret either, but it is pushed to a live project, and a file arriving
# half-filled from a merge is a file that pushes half a configuration.
!.env.production.example
